WEBVTT

00:00:04.415 --> 00:00:07.873
Well done, as always, Naomi!

00:00:10.287 --> 00:00:13.586
That rotten brain of yours needs an overhaul!

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.496
Wait, Naomi! That's not enough!

00:00:18.496 --> 00:00:21.158
Give me more of your love energy!

00:00:21.399 --> 00:00:23.467
Shut up! I'm busy!

00:00:23.467 --> 00:00:25.736
I've got the nationwide exams tomorrow!

00:00:25.736 --> 00:00:27.636
Again, I face it...

00:00:29.407 --> 00:00:32.076
The truth is, next year, Naomi takes
her university entrance exams.

00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:34.979
It's about time I started to
seriously think about her future.

00:00:34.979 --> 00:00:38.176
To think, little Naomi has
already reached this age...

00:00:38.582 --> 00:00:40.982
No, stop that! You're getting
weepy in your old age!

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:42.920
Mister.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.409
Yes?

00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:51.387
Oh! Who would expect to see such
a pitiful girl in the 21st century?

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:54.024
Do you like flowers?

00:00:54.398 --> 00:00:58.035
Yes, I love them! I'll take them all!

00:00:58.035 --> 00:01:00.104
So, hurry home, now!

00:01:00.104 --> 00:01:02.973
A darling little girl like you
shouldn't be doing this.

00:01:02.973 --> 00:01:05.840
Thank you, kind sir. Or, rather...

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:09.313
On site supervisor for special esper Wild Cat.

00:01:09.313 --> 00:01:10.974
Captain Ichiro Tanizaki.

00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:14.884
Who are?!

00:01:22.126 --> 00:01:23.991
Filthy...

00:01:24.628 --> 00:01:31.727
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:32.736 --> 00:01:38.606
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:41.045 --> 00:01:46.847
Meeting you like I did

00:01:47.184 --> 00:01:52.053
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:53.324 --> 00:01:58.853
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:59.263 --> 00:02:03.859
And surely change the future

00:02:04.468 --> 00:02:07.371
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:02:07.371 --> 00:02:10.499
Is released (changing yourself)

00:02:10.641 --> 00:02:16.375
An angel's shining surges through me

00:02:17.815 --> 00:02:20.384
The "wings" that will save the world

00:02:20.384 --> 00:02:23.217
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:02:23.454 --> 00:02:29.620
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.563
The power given to me

00:02:32.563 --> 00:02:35.199
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:35.199 --> 00:02:40.933
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:41.272 --> 00:02:46.801
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:54.952 --> 00:02:57.512
49th sense:
"The Impermanence of Life! Huh?
Minamoto has been?!"
Huh? Supervisor Tanizaki? no way.

00:02:57.821 --> 00:03:01.484
Yeah, we found him unconscious
this morning, but...

00:03:01.725 --> 00:03:04.094
Where am I? Who am I?

00:03:04.094 --> 00:03:05.896
Snap out of it, Supervisor!

00:03:05.896 --> 00:03:08.566
It's me! "Your" Naomi Umegae!

00:03:08.566 --> 00:03:10.834
Je t'aime... Mon amour... L'Amant... C'est la vie...

00:03:10.834 --> 00:03:12.703
It's all my fault!
Je t'aime... Mon amour... L'Amant... C'est la vie...

00:03:12.703 --> 00:03:13.137
It's because I hit his head so hard!
Je t'aime... Mon amour... L'Amant... C'est la vie...

00:03:13.137 --> 00:03:15.606
It's because I hit his head so hard!

00:03:15.606 --> 00:03:18.976
As you can see, Supervisor
Tanizaki has lost his memory.

00:03:18.976 --> 00:03:20.644
The suspicious part is that I can't find...

00:03:20.644 --> 00:03:22.874
anything specifically wrong,
so I think it's temporary.

00:03:23.914 --> 00:03:25.006
Thank goodness!

00:03:25.282 --> 00:03:27.585
You sure you don't prefer him this way, Naomi?

00:03:27.585 --> 00:03:29.053
Sakaki, don't say that!

00:03:29.053 --> 00:03:30.521
He might have a point.

00:03:30.521 --> 00:03:31.555
Right?

00:03:31.555 --> 00:03:33.123
And don't you start!

00:03:33.123 --> 00:03:35.353
Don't let the devil whisper in your ear!

00:03:36.227 --> 00:03:37.394
A thistle?

00:03:37.394 --> 00:03:42.166
Yes, he apparently had it in his
hand when they found him.

00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:46.159
I'll bet he was buying a bouquet for you, Naomi.

00:03:47.504 --> 00:03:49.673
Action request for The Children.

00:03:49.673 --> 00:03:51.575
Members and supervisory staff,
report to the control room at once!

00:03:51.575 --> 00:03:52.476
Gotta go!
Members and supervisory staff,
report to the control room at once!

00:03:52.476 --> 00:03:53.443
Members and supervisory staff,
report to the control room at once!

00:03:58.115 --> 00:04:01.085
Special esper team The Children have arrived.

00:04:01.085 --> 00:04:04.111
These girls are special espers?
They're just children, aren't they?

00:04:04.455 --> 00:04:06.690
Yes, but they're Level 7.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:10.127
They have a lot of experience
and are still growing.

00:04:10.127 --> 00:04:12.061
Why don't I start with a look inside?

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.829
Oh, my button...

00:04:14.898 --> 00:04:18.369
Ooh, could it be? Proof that you've grown here?

00:04:18.369 --> 00:04:18.936
Agh! Cut it out! Oh!

00:04:18.936 --> 00:04:20.804
My sleeves are so tight now, it's hard to move.
Agh! Cut it out! Oh!

00:04:20.804 --> 00:04:21.634
My sleeves are so tight now, it's hard to move.

00:04:23.007 --> 00:04:24.531
Oh! I've grown, too!

00:04:26.477 --> 00:04:27.444
Me, too.

00:04:27.444 --> 00:04:30.814
You said it was your sleeves.
Stop telling such sad lies!

00:04:30.814 --> 00:04:33.917
Yeah. Besides, smaller breasts are cuter.

00:04:33.917 --> 00:04:35.686
Quit playing!

00:04:35.686 --> 00:04:37.521
I'll sew them back on! Now hurry!

00:04:37.521 --> 00:04:38.419
Okay!

00:04:40.858 --> 00:04:42.993
It's like "at home" at the crime scene...

00:04:42.993 --> 00:04:43.894
All set.

00:04:43.894 --> 00:04:46.124
Thank you, Mr. Minamoto!

00:04:46.797 --> 00:04:49.166
So, who are we dealing with, here?

00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:50.534
An international criminal gang.

00:04:50.534 --> 00:04:53.804
This abandoned factory seems to be their
base of operations in our country.

00:04:53.804 --> 00:04:57.069
We also have information that they
have a high-level esper as a bodyguard.

00:04:57.374 --> 00:04:59.740
I see. That's why you requested our help.

00:05:01.712 --> 00:05:05.273
It's empty inside. No, there's still one person left!

00:05:10.654 --> 00:05:12.315
Freeze! Hands up! Surrender quietly!

00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:15.789
Look out!

00:05:26.637 --> 00:05:27.661
That burns!

00:05:28.339 --> 00:05:30.364
Kaoru, stay sharp! Aoi!

00:05:30.674 --> 00:05:31.572
All right!

00:05:36.146 --> 00:05:37.977
All right! Here I go!

00:05:40.117 --> 00:05:41.345
PSYCHIC...

00:05:41.919 --> 00:05:44.217
KAORU DRAGON KICK!

00:05:48.058 --> 00:05:48.922
Ho-wahh...

00:05:53.297 --> 00:05:56.232
Huh? Where am I? Who am I?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:57.167
Huh?

00:05:57.167 --> 00:06:00.193
He's playing dumb! Take him in!

00:06:00.637 --> 00:06:01.865
C'mon, get up!

00:06:02.639 --> 00:06:05.008
But, where am I? Who are you?

00:06:05.008 --> 00:06:06.610
Don't jerk us around!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:08.510
Um, what do you mean?

00:06:15.686 --> 00:06:17.483
This is...

00:06:18.455 --> 00:06:19.356
I did it!

00:06:19.356 --> 00:06:22.159
But you ripped your uniform, too.
And got it kind of burned.

00:06:22.159 --> 00:06:22.989
Well...

00:06:23.293 --> 00:06:27.286
Jeez, now we'll have to ask
Miss Oboro for new uniforms.

00:06:27.531 --> 00:06:28.899
Good job, everyone.

00:06:28.899 --> 00:06:31.766
Sorry, but could you three go back ahead of me?

00:06:31.835 --> 00:06:33.437
Sure, but what about you?

00:06:33.437 --> 00:06:36.600
There's some more here I want to
check out with the detectives.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.308
Sure. Gotcha.

00:06:38.308 --> 00:06:39.610
Come home, soon.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.475
And don't be such a workaholic.

00:06:42.146 --> 00:06:43.807
I get you, I get you.

00:06:48.485 --> 00:06:51.155
That esper was acting just
like Supervisor Tanizaki.

00:06:51.155 --> 00:06:53.385
And then there's that flower...

00:07:02.232 --> 00:07:05.668
In the language of flowers,
the thistle means... retribution!

00:07:12.876 --> 00:07:14.639
Look how different the sizes are!

00:07:15.813 --> 00:07:18.582
Every button on this one
was torn off at least once,

00:07:18.582 --> 00:07:20.451
and Mr. Minamoto sewed them back on.

00:07:20.451 --> 00:07:22.753
You can see where he patched
them here and there, too.

00:07:22.753 --> 00:07:25.051
These sure bring back
memories of lots of missions.

00:07:25.656 --> 00:07:28.625
Your new ones will soon be like that, too.

00:07:28.625 --> 00:07:32.296
You three and Minamoto are BABEL's best team.

00:07:32.296 --> 00:07:33.530
Doctor.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.065
Why are you here?!

00:07:35.065 --> 00:07:36.099
We didn't call you.

00:07:36.099 --> 00:07:38.090
You made Miss Kashiwagi
bring you along, didn't you?

00:07:38.469 --> 00:07:40.337
Um... Hey! It's time for dinner!

00:07:40.337 --> 00:07:41.772
Or maybe you can otherwise
occupy yourselves?

00:07:41.772 --> 00:07:46.443
How about being nice and giving me
an hour alone with Captain Kashiwagi?

00:07:46.443 --> 00:07:47.978
Get a load of Doctor Pervy.

00:07:47.978 --> 00:07:49.213
You're the worst.

00:07:49.213 --> 00:07:51.081
Don't even try it, you jerk!

00:07:51.081 --> 00:07:53.481
You lay a finger on my Oboro and I'll kill you!

00:07:54.251 --> 00:07:55.513
It's so lively here.

00:07:55.719 --> 00:07:57.414
You didn't forget anything, did you?

00:08:01.325 --> 00:08:05.696
The flower's meaning, the angel feather...
And the memory manipulation.

00:08:05.696 --> 00:08:06.964
Black Phantom?

00:08:06.964 --> 00:08:08.124
Exactly.

00:08:08.532 --> 00:08:10.500
Lieutenant Koichi Minamoto.

00:08:10.701 --> 00:08:13.704
Just as the information I obtained
from that man Tanizaki indicated,

00:08:13.704 --> 00:08:16.104
you seem like a very able person.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.631
You don't mean... You were testing me?!

00:08:25.616 --> 00:08:28.051
The obstacle has been eliminated.

00:08:28.051 --> 00:08:31.054
Excellent. Continue your investigation.

00:08:31.054 --> 00:08:33.490
If we do nothing about the
power The Children possess...

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.660
to undo our brainwashing, it will
eventually become a hindrance to us.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.218
As you command.

00:08:39.263 --> 00:08:41.094
Kaoru, quit it!

00:08:41.732 --> 00:08:42.966
Hello, Sakaki here.

00:08:42.966 --> 00:08:46.136
Are The Children and Kashiwagi there with you?

00:08:46.136 --> 00:08:47.104
Yeah.

00:08:47.104 --> 00:08:49.273
All right, don't let on any of this to them.

00:08:49.273 --> 00:08:51.935
The fact is, Minamoto was attacked.

00:08:52.543 --> 00:08:55.205
A surveillance sat spotted him
collapsed in front of the condo.

00:08:55.746 --> 00:08:59.182
It looks like someone was
waiting for him to return home.

00:08:59.583 --> 00:09:01.778
Okay, roger that. I'll get back there at once.

00:09:02.219 --> 00:09:03.954
What's up, Doc? An emergency case?

00:09:03.954 --> 00:09:07.253
If you like, I can teleport
you back to headquarters.

00:09:09.826 --> 00:09:12.563
No, it's okay. It's nothing serious.

00:09:12.563 --> 00:09:14.394
Miss Kashiwagi, could you handle things here?

00:09:14.698 --> 00:09:17.496
S-Sure. I don't mind, but...

00:09:18.402 --> 00:09:20.370
Your face says it's serious.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.306
But your mouth says it's not.

00:09:22.306 --> 00:09:24.206
You think you can fool a woman's intuition?

00:09:25.409 --> 00:09:28.045
There are two types of people in this world.

00:09:28.045 --> 00:09:31.648
Those who confess willingly
and those who need to be forced!

00:09:31.648 --> 00:09:32.983
Which are you, Doc?

00:09:32.983 --> 00:09:36.316
What's with those faces? I'd never lie to a lady!
He may be an esper,
but he's not much of a man.

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.221
Fine, be that way!

00:09:38.221 --> 00:09:41.679
Okay, his condition isn't life
threatening, so listen calmly.

00:09:45.228 --> 00:09:47.219
You think Minamoto will be all right?

00:09:48.031 --> 00:09:51.125
Hey! You were thinking of pulling an
end-run by visiting him, weren't you?!

00:09:51.368 --> 00:09:53.604
You read my mind again, didn't you?!

00:09:53.604 --> 00:09:55.538
I don't need to read it to know that!

00:09:57.608 --> 00:09:58.472
What?

00:10:01.712 --> 00:10:03.407
Take that! And that! And that!

00:10:05.549 --> 00:10:07.574
You're the one who did this to Minamoto?!

00:10:08.051 --> 00:10:10.420
No, no. My surveillance here told me that...

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:14.322
something interesting was happening,
so I just came to pay a visit.

00:10:26.136 --> 00:10:27.262
This is!

00:10:27.804 --> 00:10:32.009
I see. Certainly not life threatening, but still...

00:10:32.009 --> 00:10:36.412
Kyosuke Hyobu!

00:10:38.348 --> 00:10:41.652
You've got some nerve to
come waltzing into my house!

00:10:41.652 --> 00:10:45.247
Calm down, Fujiko.
You're smudging your makeup.

00:10:45.322 --> 00:10:47.085
What? No way! Seriously?

00:10:47.958 --> 00:10:49.960
I was leaving, anyway.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.086
Come, Momotaro.

00:10:51.628 --> 00:10:53.061
What's up?

00:10:56.967 --> 00:10:58.168
What are you doing to him?!

00:10:58.168 --> 00:10:59.269
Treatment.

00:10:59.269 --> 00:11:02.261
BABEL can't cure him, but I might be able to.

00:11:03.874 --> 00:11:06.943
Since the queen would get angry if I
took him, I'm leaving Momotaro here.

00:11:06.943 --> 00:11:08.069
Don't be mean to him.

00:11:08.145 --> 00:11:08.779
Hey!

00:11:08.779 --> 00:11:09.575
Mr. Minamoto!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:10.547
What the?!

00:11:10.547 --> 00:11:11.248
It's a wreck!

00:11:11.248 --> 00:11:12.015
What happened?

00:11:12.015 --> 00:11:13.250
Is Mr. Minamoto all right?!

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.242
Um... Where do I begin?

00:11:21.692 --> 00:11:22.659
Where?

00:11:22.659 --> 00:11:23.560
Mr. Minamoto!

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:24.394
You're awake?

00:11:24.394 --> 00:11:25.862
Who are you people?

00:11:25.862 --> 00:11:29.423
I was just in school. What am I doing here?

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.725
Mi... Minamoto?!

00:11:40.444 --> 00:11:41.934
Paramecium.

00:11:45.348 --> 00:11:46.940
I'll do my best.

00:11:47.684 --> 00:11:49.786
Supervisor Tanizaki's amnesia...

00:11:49.786 --> 00:11:52.687
has been confirmed to have roughly
the same cause as Minamoto's.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.359
The memories aren't erased.
They're still in the brain.

00:11:56.359 --> 00:11:58.987
But some sort of interference prevents
them from being remembered.

00:11:59.362 --> 00:12:02.165
Strong enough to fool
even Sakaki's psychometry,

00:12:02.165 --> 00:12:03.533
Who could have done this?

00:12:03.533 --> 00:12:04.768
I don't know.

00:12:04.768 --> 00:12:08.638
We'll need to analyze the powers of
whoever did this to return them to normal.

00:12:08.638 --> 00:12:12.409
However, that flying squirrel is
telepathically linked to Minamoto now,

00:12:12.409 --> 00:12:15.867
and the Hypno program Hyobu
implanted seems to be treating him.

00:12:16.179 --> 00:12:18.882
Hyobu isn't the type to do anything
out of the goodness of his heart.

00:12:18.882 --> 00:12:20.584
He must be working some kind of angle.

00:12:20.584 --> 00:12:24.921
For now, I'd advise we leave the squirrel
alone and keep him near Minamoto.

00:12:24.921 --> 00:12:27.257
Damn it, the major has us dancing to his song!

00:12:27.257 --> 00:12:28.992
And why do we see him as a child?

00:12:28.992 --> 00:12:34.731
Minamoto is actually still an adult,
but the Hypno is disrupting our visual data.

00:12:34.731 --> 00:12:37.359
Showing us an illusion of
him being a boy, you mean?

00:12:37.634 --> 00:12:41.035
However, Minamoto's lost
about 10 years of memories.

00:12:41.271 --> 00:12:45.367
Meaning, thanks to the Hypno,
his mind and appearance now match.

00:12:45.876 --> 00:12:49.642
So, it's been 10 years from my time...
I mean, since the time I remember.

00:12:49.746 --> 00:12:52.271
Oh, man. This is like a time slip.

00:12:52.582 --> 00:12:54.451
Still, you're pretty impressive, Mr. Minamoto.

00:12:54.451 --> 00:12:57.354
You understood so quickly,
and you're calm, even in that state.

00:12:57.354 --> 00:12:59.389
Not like I have much choice.

00:12:59.389 --> 00:13:01.291
Besides, my being attacked probably means...

00:13:01.291 --> 00:13:03.987
my adult self was close to
figuring out who the culprit is.

00:13:04.895 --> 00:13:06.663
I think it's just a matter of time before...

00:13:06.663 --> 00:13:09.154
the espers here at BABEL follow
that line and capture them.

00:13:09.432 --> 00:13:12.026
There must be some clues here. Hatsune!

00:13:12.335 --> 00:13:13.063
Roger!

00:13:17.941 --> 00:13:20.501
Minamoto, we'll definitely avenge you.

00:13:20.977 --> 00:13:22.412
It's amazing!

00:13:22.412 --> 00:13:24.147
A boy genius, all right.

00:13:24.147 --> 00:13:26.016
You wouldn't guess we were all the same age.

00:13:26.016 --> 00:13:29.383
You know, since I'm here,
there's a lot of stuff I'd like to see.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:33.256
I mean, naturally, I'm interested in
seeing how the world is 10 years later.

00:13:33.256 --> 00:13:35.392
Can you take me outside and show me around?

00:13:35.392 --> 00:13:37.260
Please, Shiho.

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:37.954
Aoi.

00:13:38.395 --> 00:13:39.657
And Kaoru.

00:13:40.297 --> 00:13:41.231
How about this?

00:13:41.231 --> 00:13:43.466
No, no! This is way sexier!

00:13:43.466 --> 00:13:44.501
How daring!

00:13:44.501 --> 00:13:45.602
Will this do?

00:13:45.602 --> 00:13:48.400
Um... What are you doing?

00:13:49.673 --> 00:13:51.608
What do you think? Getting you some clothes.

00:13:51.608 --> 00:13:53.210
Those are all girl's clothes!

00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:55.045
You shouldn't underestimate BABEL security.

00:13:55.045 --> 00:13:56.376
Dressing as a girl's the only way to get out!

00:13:56.713 --> 00:13:58.081
So, put this on!

00:13:58.081 --> 00:14:00.345
We'll call you "Hermione Minamoto"!

00:14:01.084 --> 00:14:03.253
Please stop, master!

00:14:03.253 --> 00:14:04.654
You've got to be kidding!

00:14:04.654 --> 00:14:06.857
And why do you have me
dressed like a maid and crying?!

00:14:06.857 --> 00:14:09.526
Relax! You'll be enjoying it in no time!

00:14:09.526 --> 00:14:10.527
Right, right!

00:14:10.527 --> 00:14:12.762
In that case, time to use my powers.

00:14:12.762 --> 00:14:14.559
Stop it!

00:14:14.931 --> 00:14:16.262
Teleportation Costume Change!

00:14:22.005 --> 00:14:23.996
What are you doing, Aoi?

00:14:25.075 --> 00:14:26.710
No, something's wrong.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:29.212
My teleport coordinates
aren't matching my senses.

00:14:29.212 --> 00:14:32.204
I get it. It's because this form I have isn't real.

00:14:32.649 --> 00:14:37.177
You see me as a kid because of the Hypno,
but I still really have an adult body.

00:14:37.988 --> 00:14:39.789
Okay, so now what?

00:14:39.789 --> 00:14:41.424
Let's go to Dr. Sakaki's place!

00:14:41.424 --> 00:14:44.257
He must have some man-sized
women's clothing.

00:14:44.327 --> 00:14:45.929
What?! I still have to dress like a girl?!

00:14:45.929 --> 00:14:47.954
I DON'T HAVE ANY!

00:14:50.233 --> 00:14:53.203
You've got permission to go out,
so just go and play, already!

00:14:53.203 --> 00:14:54.295
Here, a change of clothes.

00:14:54.371 --> 00:14:55.405
Huh? We can?

00:14:55.405 --> 00:14:57.841
And I'll give you this for now.

00:14:57.841 --> 00:14:59.741
The Children's release phone.

00:15:02.045 --> 00:15:05.081
You can contact us and release
them in an emergency.

00:15:05.081 --> 00:15:07.017
Why not just keep us released?

00:15:07.017 --> 00:15:10.748
Without your limiters, you might
get careless and lose control.

00:15:11.288 --> 00:15:13.857
We've lowered the output
to half the usual level,

00:15:13.857 --> 00:15:16.626
so their using their ESP
shouldn't cause any trouble.

00:15:16.626 --> 00:15:17.827
Can I leave this to you?

00:15:17.827 --> 00:15:21.160
Sure! Thanks for trusting me, Miss Kashiwagi!

00:15:23.566 --> 00:15:25.502
GLOMP!
Such a good boy! And so adorable!

00:15:25.502 --> 00:15:26.332
QUIT IT!

00:15:26.569 --> 00:15:29.139
The Children are the best
bodyguards he can have.

00:15:29.139 --> 00:15:32.267
And hanging out with kids may
speed up recovering your memories.

00:15:32.575 --> 00:15:35.078
Just relax and leave everything to us.

00:15:35.078 --> 00:15:35.845
Right!

00:15:35.845 --> 00:15:38.982
I'm sure you'll get me back to normal, Doctor!

00:15:38.982 --> 00:15:41.007
Please keep working on it.

00:15:43.486 --> 00:15:47.149
GLOMP!
Awesome, Minamoto! As smart
and cute as I remember you!

00:15:47.223 --> 00:15:48.417
QUIT IT!

00:15:52.696 --> 00:15:54.297
Um, girls?

00:15:54.297 --> 00:15:58.256
Oh, don't start. The weather's so nice,
why don't we fly home?

00:15:58.702 --> 00:16:00.363
Not that.

00:16:01.871 --> 00:16:05.342
It's amazing. All of you... You're amazing!

00:16:05.342 --> 00:16:08.573
Kaoru! Shiho! Aoi! You're amazing!

00:16:09.713 --> 00:16:11.748
Okay, Kaoru, fly us home!

00:16:11.748 --> 00:16:12.874
Roger!

00:16:15.452 --> 00:16:17.784
We can go even faster if you release our limiters!

00:16:17.854 --> 00:16:21.391
No, this is fine.
They said it's for emergencies, right?

00:16:21.391 --> 00:16:25.395
Oh, lame! Even as a kid, you're still the boss!

00:16:25.395 --> 00:16:28.631
How can he not be?
Mr. Minamoto is still Mr. Minamoto.

00:16:28.631 --> 00:16:31.868
He's a boy genius, not a regular kid.

00:16:31.868 --> 00:16:33.358
That's not true.

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.434
I am just a regular kid.

00:16:41.644 --> 00:16:43.578
That's right, Minamoto.

00:16:44.047 --> 00:16:45.947
You're just a regular kid.

00:16:48.385 --> 00:16:51.252
Huh? Why's it look like
something out of The Thing?

00:16:51.588 --> 00:16:54.124
I told you I couldn't cook.

00:16:54.124 --> 00:16:57.594
I guess that's a skill you
pick up in the next 10 years.

00:16:57.594 --> 00:16:59.425
Why don't we eat these tonight?

00:17:00.096 --> 00:17:00.653
What?

00:17:02.132 --> 00:17:03.733
Mm, delicious!

00:17:03.733 --> 00:17:05.201
Did you make them?

00:17:05.201 --> 00:17:07.170
No way! Way too much trouble.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.035
You made these for us.

00:17:09.672 --> 00:17:10.540
I did?

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.508
Hurry up and eat. And then...

00:17:12.776 --> 00:17:14.644
The four of us need to get in the bath!

00:17:14.644 --> 00:17:15.979
As usual.

00:17:15.979 --> 00:17:17.776
Ooh, nice idea!

00:17:18.381 --> 00:17:21.551
Hold it! "As usual?" Aren't I 21 years old?!

00:17:21.551 --> 00:17:23.253
But we're all kids now!

00:17:23.253 --> 00:17:26.188
That's gonna be kinda tough
for a 5th grader to do!

00:17:26.723 --> 00:17:27.314
Huh?

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:29.159
Don't take it seriously.

00:17:29.159 --> 00:17:30.922
Minamoto, you perv!

00:17:31.694 --> 00:17:33.363
Oh, you were sort of hoping
we were being serious, huh?

00:17:33.363 --> 00:17:34.431
Hey...

00:17:34.431 --> 00:17:35.227
Still!

00:17:35.999 --> 00:17:37.400
You're sleeping with us!

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:39.469
Come on, this is okay, right?

00:17:39.469 --> 00:17:41.504
This is wrong, too!

00:17:41.504 --> 00:17:44.803
What's wrong about it?
Shiho doesn't understand!

00:17:49.746 --> 00:17:53.011
Jeez... Where's the room I was using?

00:17:55.652 --> 00:17:58.212
Play with us some more, Minamoto...

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:03.555
If they can't get me back to normal,

00:18:03.893 --> 00:18:06.259
can there be a place for me here?

00:18:07.464 --> 00:18:10.058
Huh? Four backpacks?!

00:18:10.233 --> 00:18:11.928
Who brought them, and when?

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:15.062
Major Hyobu!

00:18:15.538 --> 00:18:17.040
Take care of the kid.

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.302
And have fun.

00:18:21.177 --> 00:18:22.178
Morning!

00:18:22.178 --> 00:18:23.913
C'mon, Minamoto! Let's get to school!

00:18:23.913 --> 00:18:26.349
What's Tono talking about?

00:18:26.349 --> 00:18:28.476
Major Hyobu must have done something.

00:18:29.352 --> 00:18:30.910
School?

00:18:30.987 --> 00:18:32.852
ROKUJOIN ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:18:32.922 --> 00:18:33.223
MINAMOTO

00:18:33.223 --> 00:18:34.757
MINAMOTO
There it is... I have a seat here.

00:18:34.757 --> 00:18:36.326
There it is... I have a seat here.

00:18:36.326 --> 00:18:39.591
I told you. You guys are acting weird.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:42.191
There's even a cage for Momotaro.

00:18:42.432 --> 00:18:44.734
And Mr. Minamoto has class pet duty, I see.

00:18:44.734 --> 00:18:46.292
This is a detailed setup.

00:18:47.604 --> 00:18:50.473
You like your wheel, don't you, Momotaro?

00:18:50.473 --> 00:18:51.307
Good morning!

00:18:51.307 --> 00:18:53.468
Momotaro's really frisky today, huh?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:57.647
Looks like the major's hypnotized
everyone involved in this.

00:18:57.647 --> 00:18:59.315
What's he up to?

00:18:59.315 --> 00:19:00.984
Let's contact HQ.

00:19:00.984 --> 00:19:03.286
Any way you look at this,
something weird is going on.

00:19:03.286 --> 00:19:04.719
Stop that, Minamoto!

00:19:05.288 --> 00:19:08.746
No cell phones in school! Not allowed.

00:19:09.025 --> 00:19:12.028
Agh! A picture-perfect suspicious person!

00:19:12.028 --> 00:19:12.595
You!

00:19:12.595 --> 00:19:14.085
Run, Mr. Minamoto!

00:19:14.164 --> 00:19:16.064
What are you doing here, you perverted esper?!

00:19:16.799 --> 00:19:18.733
Stay away from Minamoto!

00:19:19.636 --> 00:19:21.638
Ooh! Right in the Mr. Kinpachis!

00:19:21.638 --> 00:19:23.740
Save us, Nube!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.937
Girls, stop! What are you doing
to our teacher, Mr. Ohkama?!

00:19:28.378 --> 00:19:30.213
Teacher? Him?!

00:19:30.213 --> 00:19:31.237
Exactly!

00:19:33.416 --> 00:19:36.715
Good morning, I say! Everyone!

00:19:37.654 --> 00:19:39.355
What are you doing here, too?!

00:19:39.355 --> 00:19:42.892
School violence?! Bullying's lame, I say!

00:19:42.892 --> 00:19:44.294
What's with the "I say"?!

00:19:44.294 --> 00:19:46.194
Is that supposed to hide how stupid you are?!

00:19:46.296 --> 00:19:50.858
Don't cause any trouble. Or don't you
care about these other kids?

00:19:52.335 --> 00:19:55.705
PANDRA has taken over the school for today.

00:19:55.705 --> 00:19:57.935
Any funny business and it'll be all-out war!

00:19:58.441 --> 00:20:00.743
So, why are we doing this, again?

00:20:00.743 --> 00:20:02.472
Don't ask. We're always doing stuff like this.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.415
Why are you doing this?

00:20:05.415 --> 00:20:07.984
Dunno. Major's orders.

00:20:07.984 --> 00:20:10.043
And now the other students are mixed up in this?

00:20:10.119 --> 00:20:13.223
If we didn't, you couldn't have a
normal school day, now could you?

00:20:13.223 --> 00:20:15.783
And it gives us some hostages
to keep out any interlopers.

00:20:16.392 --> 00:20:18.860
It's okay. We're not going
to do anything to them.

00:20:20.763 --> 00:20:23.733
Right now, this school is made for you.

00:20:23.733 --> 00:20:25.792
So, what are you going to do, Mini Minamoto?

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:28.605
I-I...

00:20:28.605 --> 00:20:29.572
Minamoto?

00:20:29.872 --> 00:20:34.809
The thing is, I... They made me
leave my school just yesterday.

00:20:36.045 --> 00:20:37.034
Why?

00:20:37.313 --> 00:20:40.116
Because having a student like
me was a bother to them.

00:20:40.116 --> 00:20:42.311
They said I should go into
the gifted student program.

00:20:42.986 --> 00:20:46.478
That's right... Why couldn't
I have handled that better?

00:20:46.856 --> 00:20:49.654
They might have let me
stay with the other kids, then.

00:20:51.861 --> 00:20:53.196
Kaoru!

00:20:53.196 --> 00:20:55.596
How many times do I have to tell you,
don't blow up your classmates!

00:20:55.865 --> 00:20:58.800
Our very own... desks!

00:21:01.504 --> 00:21:03.267
Was school fun?

00:21:08.144 --> 00:21:09.975
So, I...

00:21:10.513 --> 00:21:13.676
I could go along with this, for a little while.

00:21:14.083 --> 00:21:16.386
Okay! Roger that, Mr. Minamoto!

00:21:16.386 --> 00:21:20.789
We're able to go to school because
of what you and the chief did.

00:21:21.924 --> 00:21:24.893
And I kinda like it.
Having Minamoto as a classmate!

00:21:27.163 --> 00:21:28.357
You girls...

00:21:29.766 --> 00:21:32.302
Now that that's settled, let's begin class!

00:21:32.302 --> 00:21:33.599
It's show time!

00:21:34.437 --> 00:21:35.505
But first...
Ding-dong! Ding-dong!
The students' gaze is upon me!

00:21:35.505 --> 00:21:38.531
Hang on while we teach
this idiot our own lesson.
Ding-dong! Ding-dong!
The students' gaze is upon me!

00:21:43.913 --> 00:21:47.178
I'll give you a day of fun, my dear Minamoto.

00:21:51.187 --> 00:21:53.178
I won't forgive you...

00:21:54.324 --> 00:21:56.588
Hatsune... Run...

00:21:57.393 --> 00:21:58.795
Akira! Akira!

00:21:58.795 --> 00:22:00.262
Silence, animal!

00:22:05.268 --> 00:22:07.793
Just you wait, Queen.

00:22:20.917 --> 00:22:24.554
I turn to the front, embracing the dream

00:22:24.554 --> 00:22:28.524
Making up my mind, looking up to the sky

00:22:28.524 --> 00:22:34.564
I'll fly beyond the future with my wings

00:22:34.564 --> 00:22:38.468
You alone are my heart's desire!

00:22:38.468 --> 00:22:42.405
I declared that I love you absolutely

00:22:42.405 --> 00:22:48.310
As the shining seasons pass

00:22:49.045 --> 00:22:53.116
Your face is still as troubled as in

00:22:53.116 --> 00:22:56.984
The photos I took to remember those days

00:22:57.587 --> 00:23:03.822
As I shed warm, gentle tears

00:23:05.027 --> 00:23:08.598
Let's try to meet here tomorrow, too

00:23:08.598 --> 00:23:12.168
Without making promises, let's go

00:23:12.168 --> 00:23:16.105
As casually as always

00:23:16.105 --> 00:23:21.372
Waving my little hand with a smile

00:23:22.378 --> 00:23:27.179
"Bye bye, till we meet again"

00:23:41.164 --> 00:23:41.998
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.998 --> 00:23:42.965
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.266 --> 00:23:47.236
This isn't where we belong. This isn't your class.

00:23:47.236 --> 00:23:50.072
I know, but it can't be helped!
It's just for today!

00:23:50.072 --> 00:23:53.242
If you truly wish it,
this doesn't have to be an illusion.

00:23:53.242 --> 00:23:54.444
I'll make it real.

00:23:54.444 --> 00:23:55.411
Really?

00:23:55.411 --> 00:23:56.776
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:56.846 --> 00:23:59.649
Episode 50: "Giving It All You Have!
Over The Future!"

00:23:59.649 --> 00:24:01.784
Don't! I know this is fun, but!

00:24:01.784 --> 00:24:03.486
We like being with you, Mr. Minamoto, but!

00:24:03.486 --> 00:24:05.078
That's right! This is wrong!

00:24:05.388 --> 00:24:06.155
I...

00:24:06.155 --> 00:24:06.656
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.656 --> 00:24:08.224
Giving It All You Have!
Over The Future
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.224 --> 00:24:09.987
Giving It All You Have!
Over The Future
